Would it be better to be unobtrusive here and [add a `click` event listener](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener) on the element (identifying it by its ID of `theme-toggle`)?

e.g.

```javascript
document.getElementById("theme-toggle").addEventListener("click", (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();

  toggleTheme();
});
```

